Lambretta (ꦭꦩ꧀ꦧꦿꦺꦠ꧀ꦠ) (]) yaiku &lt;a href="pit%20montor"&gt;pit montor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="skuter"&gt;skuter&lt;/a&gt; sing wiwitani diprodhuksi saka kutha &lt;a href="Milan%20%28disambiguasi%29"&gt;Milan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Innocenti"&gt;Innocenti&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng "Lambretta" dijupuk saka aran bengawan Lambro kang liwati distrik Lambrate, jeneng "Lambretta" ugi dijupuk saka tembung "Lambrus" kang dhuwé erti 'énthéng (boboté), gesit lan cepet'.
