<li>Putri: bal baskèt (1960), dhayung (1975), lumayu lintas désa (1976), hoki lapangan (1960), golf (2001), lacrosse (1975), bal-balan (1991), sofbol (2005), langi lan nyilem (1975), ténis (1960), trèk lan lapangan (1976), lan bal voli (1960)</li>
<li>Gabungan: &lt;a href="lelayaran"&gt;lelayaran&lt;/a&gt; (1937)</li>
