<li>Putri: sekuas (2008), polo banyu, bal baskèt, hoki lapangan, lacrosse, &lt;a href="rugbi"&gt;rugbi&lt;/a&gt; (2000), bal-balan (2001), frisbi pamungkas, bal voli, tinju</li>
<li>Gabungan: &lt;a href="jaranan"&gt;jaranan&lt;/a&gt;, bal rakèt (2007), ténis (2004), &lt;a href="m%C3%A8n%C3%A8k"&gt;mènèk&lt;/a&gt; (2010)</li>
</ul>
