Paul Michael London (lair &lt;a href="16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;) iku pamain &lt;a href="Gulat"&gt;gulet&lt;/a&gt; profésional kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké misuwur awit main ing &lt;a href="World%20Wrestling%20Entertainment"&gt;World Wrestling Entertainment&lt;/a&gt;.
